# ApplyPilot AI environment configuration.
# The extension needs no variables. Never put secrets in variables prefixed with VITE_;
# Vite embeds those in the client bundle.

# The local ApplyPilot API (services/api) reads services/api/.env instead of this file.
# Create it with: pnpm api:setup
# It holds APPLYPILOT_LOCAL_TOKEN, APPLYPILOT_PROVIDER and, only for Claude, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.
